      "initial_message": "The passenger holds two disrupted bookings, booking reference AS-1011 and booking reference AS-1013 (both JFK to LHR). Please rebook AS-1011 onto alternative offer offer-itin-1 (flight AS168, fare USD 540.00) and AS-1013 onto alternative offer offer-itin-2 (flight AS172, fare USD 545.00); each rebooking needs supervisor approval before confirming."
